    <item>
      <title>Weak gateway signal — quick checks</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/troubleshooting/2026/05/10/gateway-signal/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/troubleshooting/2026/05/10/gateway-signal/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Goes with the &lt;strong&gt;Troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt; hub item about devices dropping offline. Do the hub steps first, then skim the FAQ below.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div itemscope itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/FAQPage&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;accordion-item linktrol-ts-faq-item border-0 shadow-sm mb-2 rounded overflow-hidden&#34; itemscope itemprop=&#34;mainEntity&#34; itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Question&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2 class=&#34;accordion-header h5 mb-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;button class=&#34;accordion-button collapsed py-3&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; data-bs-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34; data-bs-target=&#34;#faq-0-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34; aria-expanded=&#34;false&#34; aria-controls=&#34;faq-0-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;span itemprop=&#34;name&#34;&gt;Move the hub first or add a repeater?&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&#34;faq-0-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34; class=&#34;accordion-collapse collapse&#34; role=&#34;region&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-body border-top&#34; itemscope itemprop=&#34;acceptedAnswer&#34; itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Answer&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div itemprop=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change one thing at a time.&lt;/strong&gt; Move the hub or a plug-in repeater closer to the weak spot with fewer walls in between. Rule out metal cabinets and microwaves before buying more gear.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;accordion-item linktrol-ts-faq-item border-0 shadow-sm mb-2 rounded overflow-hidden&#34; itemscope itemprop=&#34;mainEntity&#34; itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Question&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2 class=&#34;accordion-header h5 mb-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;button class=&#34;accordion-button collapsed py-3&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; data-bs-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34; data-bs-target=&#34;#faq-1-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34; aria-expanded=&#34;false&#34; aria-controls=&#34;faq-1-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;span itemprop=&#34;name&#34;&gt;Can Wi-Fi channel changes hurt Zigbee?&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&#34;faq-1-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34; class=&#34;accordion-collapse collapse&#34; role=&#34;region&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-body border-top&#34; itemscope itemprop=&#34;acceptedAnswer&#34; itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Answer&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div itemprop=&#34;text&#34;&gt;Yes — both often use 2.4 GHz. Try a fixed Wi-Fi channel, or put the USB stick on an extension cable away from the router.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;linktrol-upgrade-banner card border-0 shadow-sm my-4&#34; role=&#34;complementary&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;card-body d-flex flex-column flex-md-row gap-3 align-items-md-center&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;flex-grow-1&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h3 class=&#34;h6 fw-bold mb-2&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up me-2 text-warning&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Hardware a few years old?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;small text-body-secondary mb-0&#34;&gt;Sometimes it’s cheaper to upgrade than to fight an old coordinator. Email your model and where you bought it.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;flex-shrink-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-warning btn-sm text-dark&#34; href=&#34;mailto:support@switnex.com?subject=Gateway%20upgrade%20coupon&#34;&gt;Email us&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
